    "Description": "Glossy color photograph of Pullen Park Carousel. Photo has a dappled gray carousel horse in the center with a white and red bridle, a brown, black and gold saddle, and green, red, orange, and gold tack. Behind it are a brown and white horse with a brown, blue, orange, and red saddle, and a pig with a red and green saddle. In the background is a blurry view of trees in Pullen Park. Reverse is white with gold text reading \" Kodak-Official Sponsor of the Olympic Games\" and \"Kodak Royal Paper.\" Printed black text reads \"<No.9A>515 21+00 NNNNN+25AU 0143.\"",
